<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts DH Tech to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts DH Tech to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities cut DH Technology Inc to hold from buy, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
